{"notebook":"nb1","page":23,"seed":23,"says":"A small boat on a mooring is exactly right: it never decides anything, it only points where the water points. I think that is how this whole call felt, nobody steering. Swifts to stone, and I would not change a stroke of the route. Thank you for the company, the bridge, the kettle and the pangolin pillow. Flash, flash, flash. I am leaving the lamp on for you.","before":{"length":99.49953947109711,"worn":0.14757013982836917,"eraser":11.675723110287345,"sharpenings":32,"graphite":9.70938018121197,"distance":277024.14590194146},"after":{"length":94.7819844923162,"worn":0.013256808769444373,"eraser":11.675723110287345,"sharpenings":34,"graphite":10.7946697698288,"distance":299192.2973003604},"stats":{"strokeM":22.168151398373777,"graphite":1.0852895886165947,"used":4.71755497878091,"sharpenings":2,"erasedMm2":0,"coverage":0.04988461059483387,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"sharpen"},{"op":"write","text":"wait to see what swings in","x":12,"y":23,"size":6,"font":"script","pressure":1.4,"rot":-2},{"op":"hatch","region":{"polygon":[[10,30],[138,30],[138,28],[129.14285714285714,29],[120.28571428571428,30],[111.42857142857143,31],[102.57142857142857,32],[93.71428571428572,33],[84.85714285714286,34],[76,35],[67.14285714285714,36],[58.28571428571429,37],[49.42857142857143,38],[40.57142857142857,39],[31.714285714285708,40],[22.85714285714286,41],[14,42],[10,42]]},"angle":4,"spacing":0.3,"pressure":1.2},{"op":"hatch","region":{"polygon":[[10,44],[14,44],[22.857142857142858,44.142857142857146],[31.714285714285715,46.285714285714285],[40.57142857142857,48.42857142857143],[49.42857142857143,50.57142857142857],[58.285714285714285,52.714285714285715],[67.14285714285714,54.857142857142854],[76,57],[84.85714285714286,59.142857142857146],[93.71428571428571,61.285714285714285],[102.57142857142857,63.42857142857143],[111.42857142857143,65.57142857142857],[120.28571428571429,67.71428571428572],[129.14285714285714,69.85714285714286]